y USB. External regulated 5V feeds LEDs/MAX7219 only. VIN/VUSB are not joined to external 5V." (at 25 32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "7ba81263-ba2c-4beb-8a1a-f9365144e632")) (text "J20 cable goes directly to the unchanged LED Subboard. J10 goes to Main Board controls. J21 feeds Main Board backlights." (at 25 145 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "6762e075-a5c1-4067-9bb9-b095bff5f321")) (text "DCS-BIOS: MAX7219 intensity controls display brightness; GPIO9 PWM controls panel backlighting." (at 25 157 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "ac365f41-2b43-422c-b827-c9ab4e0a32d0")) (text "MAIN/PRESET use direct grounded contacts, no resistor ladders. Enable internal pull-ups for all 26 control GPIO inputs." (at 25 170 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "ff15be5b-d149-4c87-8706-a535cf69ebeb")) (text "GPIO assignment is a new ARC-164 draft; firmware must be updated to match GPIO-Assignments.json." (at 25 183 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "9cdf6fef-2262-4d3e-874a-5004f937c443")) (text "19 green backlight LEDs and individual 330 ohm series resistors are on Main Board; physical clearance and brightness need prototype testing." (at 25 350 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "53a31fa8-bdf9-4bf3-bd1e-e349e8c4ed51")) (embedded_fonts no) (wire (pts (xy 345.44 207.01) (xy 340.36 207.01)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "d2d15f73-c8ff-4d94-8654-957d7888309b")) (label "SEG1_A" (at 340.36 207.01 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "3b435ecb-0c33-40a3-a583-4a38c073c022")) (wire (pts (xy 358.14 207.01) (xy 363.22 207.01)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "06f39b47-b666-4e22-a06d-7c2326540fbf")) (label "SEG1_B" (at 363.22 207.01 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d997e6c2-4716-497b-9f9d-11297d7cb816")) (wire (pts (xy 345.44 209.55) (xy 340.36 209.55)) (stroke (width 0) (typ